          "label": "Transparency and Justice",
          "kind": "text",
          "default": {
            "id": "4c2200f909eae3ed",
            "title": "Transparency and Justice",
            "subtitle": "",
            "body": "We believe in transparency, accountability, and equal justice under the law. We stand with survivors of abuse and those whose voices have been ignored or silenced. Every person deserves to be treated with dignity, and justice should never depend on wealth, status, or political connections.",
