          "kind": "text",
          "default": {
            "id": "e42a85152f8dc0ed",
            "title": "Civic Education and Participation",
            "subtitle": "",
            "body": "Knowledge is power, and it belongs to everyone. We believe people should understand their rights, how their government works, and how to make their voices heard. Through accessible, nonpartisan civic education, we help our communities build the knowledge and confidence to participate in democracy.",
