          "default": {
            "id": "9773c514cd59c685",
            "title": "Solidarity in Action",
            "subtitle": "",
            "body": "We bring the spirit of the pit into our communities: when someone falls, we pick them up. We look out for one another, make space for everyone, and refuse to leave people behind. Through music, mutual aid, and community service, we turn solidarity into action.",
